prompt_template:
Create one full-bleed {ASPECT_RATIO} key-visual poster for a fictional mecha anime film in the Cover Unit style, laid out like an anime monthly cover.
Render: crisp black ink line art, flat two-tone cel shading, flat vermilion and amber livery panels with chipped edges, loose ultramarine violet watercolour washes behind, one hard pale violet cast shadow.
Ground: white paper with faint grain, about one third empty.
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Action: {SUBJECT_ACTION}
Composition, lettering style and secondary text: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Title, exact: "{MAIN_TEXT}", spelled letter by letter, masthead scale, in the case's own lettering style, partly covered by the subject.
Palette: paper white and cool grey, ultramarine violet and deep indigo, vermilion red, amber yellow, black ink line; violet, vermilion and amber all visible.
Information layer: 'A FILM BY' line, two-line vermilion tagline, three cover lines with triangle bullets, IN CINEMAS with huge stacked date numerals, hazard-stripe technical strip with unit code, one credit row; each exactly once.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
